[97.822238, "o", "## 🚫 Preflight Verdict: BLOCK\r\n\r\n**Do not proceed with this upgrade.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Run metadata\r\n\r\n| Field | Value |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| **Verdict** | `BLOCK` |\r\n| **Fingerprint** | `67c8f02774972c195947d2e4183295c9372bb96c8cbc92f042a689191d862010` |\r\n| **Tool** | helm-agent-preflight v0.1.0 (commit `91250d3`) |\r\n| **No deployment occurred** | ✅ confirmed |\r\n| **Evidence completeness** | `COMPLETE` |\r\n| **Rendering stability** | ✅ confirmed |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🔴 Security Findings — 2 × CRITICAL (both new, not pre-existing)\r\n\r\n**RBAC-001 · `ClusterRole/webapp-reader` · `$.rules[0].resources`**\r\n> Wildcard `*` in `resources` grants access to **all resource types**\r\n\r\n**RBAC-002 · `ClusterRole/webapp-reader` · `$.rules[0].verbs`**\r\n> Wildcard `*` in `verbs` grants **all operations**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Diff summary\r\n\r\n| | Count |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Modified | **1** |\r\n| Added | 0 |\r\n| Removed | 0 |\r\n\r\nThe sole change is `ClusterRole/webapp-reader`. The candidate replaces the safe, scoped baseline rules with full wildcards:\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n# Baseline (safe)\r\nrules:\r\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\r\n    resources: [\"pods\", \"services\"]\r\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"list\", \"watch\"]\r\n\r\n# Candidate (blocked) — effectively cluster-admin\r\nrules:\r\n  - apiGroups: [\"*\"]\r\n    resources: [\"*\"]\r\n    verbs: [\"*\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Proposed fix\r\n\r\nReplace the wildcard rule in `examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/rbac.yaml` with an explicit, minimal set. Keep only what the new feature actually needs — for example:\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nrules:\r\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\r\n    resources: [\"pods\", \"services\"]\r\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"list\", \"watch\"]\r\n  # Add only the specific new permissions the feature requires, e.g.:\r\n  # - apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\r\n  #   resources: [\"deployments\"]\r\n  #   verbs: [\"get\", \"list\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nSay the word and I'll apply the fix and re-run the preflight check to confirm a PASS verdict. Human authorization is required before I modify any project files.\r\n"]
